<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Kevco Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Kevco Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			Kevco Inc</p>
<p>Nasdaq Stock symbol	     KVCO.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $11-$13/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.1 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.1 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    6,494,500</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  315,000 shrs Business: wholesale distributor of building products to the manufacturing housing and recreational vehicle industries.  </p>
<p>(*) - Use of Proceeds: Reduce indebtedness, including Prior S Corporation earnings note issued in connection with the corporation distribution</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s:     1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Net Sales	    $182,519	    $99,279</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $7,031	     $5,297</p>
<p>(*) - prior to the offering, Kevco elected to be treated as a S corporation under the provisions of subchapter S of the Internal Revenue Code.</p>
